# The repo root ignores *.log (.gitignore:62). These three ARE the fixture:
# ring_table.solve discovers its source boot by the NAMES `<stem>.front.log`,
# `<stem>.P.log` and `<stem>.D.log` (ring_table._boot_stems), so they cannot be
# renamed to a non-.log extension without breaking the discovery this replay
# exists to exercise. Un-ignored HERE rather than committed with `git add -f`,
# so the next person who adds a recorded boot log to this directory does not
# have to know the trick -- and #1329's fixture cannot silently stop being
# carried by the repo. Caught before the first push: the first `git add` of
# this tree committed the sidecar and silently skipped all three logs.
!*.log
